{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2021-01-13 11:30:00', 'title': "PEEL REGIONAL POLICE SELECTS MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS' INTEGRATED SOFTWARE AND VIDEO SOLUTIONS TO HELP KEEP COMMUNITIES SAFE", 'text': 'REGION OF PEEL, ONTARIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PEEL REGIONAL POLICE IS TEAMING UP WITH MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS (NYSE:MSI) TO DEPLOY MISSION CRITICAL END-TO-END SOFTWARE AND VIDEO SOLUTIONS TO ENHANCE OFFICER AND COMMUNITY SAFETY AND WELLBEING FOR THE NEARLY 1.4 MILLION RESIDENTS AND VISITORS OF THE CITIES OF BRAMPTON, MISSISSAUGA, AND AT PEARSON INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT. PEEL REGIONAL POLICE IS A PROGRESSIVE, FORWARD-THINKING AGENCY THAT WILL ADVANCE THEIR TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM BY DEPLOYING MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS'}